MIT 8103 Advanced Database Systems - Portfolio 2
Query Processing and Optimisation
Student: Amaka Benedicta Chukwudebe (2026/A/MIT/0517)
Case study: CampusNest - Private Student Accommodation Booking
===================================================================

This file contains the 7 queries for Portfolio 2.
Each query is preceded by a plain-English description of what it
answers for the CampusNest operations team.

If Q1 returns zero rows, the lodge name Akoka Heights Lodge is
not present in your Portfolio 1 data. Run: SELECT name FROM lodge;
and substitute a real name in the WHERE clause below.

